msgstr "Мешки изъеденных молью кукол"

#. ja: ソーン朝時代に作られた人形飾り。古びて衣装が使い物にならない
#. de: Eine Kiste, die eine alte Puppe aus der Thorne-Dynastie enthält. Die mottenzerfressene Kleidung der Puppe ist zu nichts mehr zu gebrauchen.
#. fr: Une boîte contenant une poupée très ancienne qui remonte à la dynastie des Thorne. Ses vêtements tombent en lambeaux.
#. column 0: sack of moth-eaten doll parts
#. column 2: sacks of moth-eaten doll parts
#. column 9: Moth-eaten Doll Parts
msgctxt "Item:10089:0:8"
msgid "A collection of antique dolls dating back to the Thorne Dynasty. The miniature costumes are in a sorry state, most being moth-eaten and threadbare."
msgstr "Собрание старинных кукол эпохи династии Торн. Их миниатюрные наряды в плачевном состоянии: большинство изъедены молью и износились до дыр."

#. ja: 古の人形飾り
#. de: Alte Puppe
#. fr: Vieille poupée
#. column 0: sack of moth-eaten doll parts
#. column 2: sacks of moth-eaten doll parts
#. column 8: A collection of antique dolls dating back to the Thorne Dynasty. The miniature costumes are in a sorry state, most being moth-eaten and threadbare.
msgctxt "Item:10089:0:9"
msgid "Moth-eaten Doll Parts"
msgstr "Изъеденные молью куклы"

#. ja: ブロークンチェスト
#. de: zerbrochen[a] Truhe
#. fr: coffre brisé
#. column 2: splintered chests
#. column 8: This chest, rumored to have once been stored aboard the <i>Haar</i>─the flagship of the dread pirate Mistbeard─appears to have been not-so-gently pried open with a headsman's axe.
#. column 9: Splintered Chest
msgctxt "Item:10090:0:0"
