#. ja: バジリスクの初卵
#. de: erstgelegt[a] Basilisken-Ei
#. fr: premier œuf de basilic
#. column 2: virgin basilisk eggs
#. column 8: While all eggs a basilisk lays contain traces of rare ore, the first egg laid in life is thought to contain the highest concentration, making it highly sought after by potion mixers and alchemists.
#. column 9: Virgin Basilisk Egg
msgctxt "Item:10093:0:0"
msgid "virgin basilisk egg"
msgstr "Первое яйцо василиска"

#. de: erstgelegt[a] Basilisken-Eier
#. fr: premiers œufs de basilic
#. column 0: virgin basilisk egg
#. column 8: While all eggs a basilisk lays contain traces of rare ore, the first egg laid in life is thought to contain the highest concentration, making it highly sought after by potion mixers and alchemists.
#. column 9: Virgin Basilisk Egg
msgctxt "Item:10093:0:2"
msgid "virgin basilisk eggs"
msgstr "Первые яйца василиска"

#. ja: バジリスクの個体が初めて産む鉱物殻の卵。その殻の粉末には特別な薬効があるとされる
#. de: Obwohl alle von Basilisken gelegten Eier Spuren von seltenen Erzen enthalten, ist die Konzentration im erstgelegten Ei am höchsten. Aus diesem Grund ist es von Alchemisten heiß begehrt.
#. fr: Un œuf issu de la première ponte d'un basilic. Une fois réduite en poudre, sa coquille très dure a des vertus médicinales.
#. column 0: virgin basilisk egg
#. column 2: virgin basilisk eggs
#. column 9: Virgin Basilisk Egg
msgctxt "Item:10093:0:8"
msgid "While all eggs a basilisk lays contain traces of rare ore, the first egg laid in life is thought to contain the highest concentration, making it highly sought after by potion mixers and alchemists."
msgstr "В каждом яйце василиска есть следы редкой руды, но считается, что в первом яйце её больше всего. Потому алхимики и изготовители зелий так высоко его ценят."

