msgstr "Первое яйцо василиска"

#. ja: リトルワーム
#. de: Winzwurm
#. fr: petit ver
#. column 2: little worms
#. column 8: While commonly used as bait by fishers across the realm, little worms also make fine chocobo feed, providing a good source of protein for growing birds.
#. column 9: Little Worm
msgctxt "Item:10094:0:0"
