#. de: Phiole[p] Indigo-Gobtunke
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant de la Main indigo
#. column 2: flasks of Illuminati gobdip
#. column 8: An alchemical potion concocted in the dark laboratoriums of the Illuminati. Some of the realm's more daring blacksmiths have applied the unnaturally viscous substance to a variety of weapons and found that it heightens the attributes of certain ancient martial artifacts. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Illuminati Gobdip
msgctxt "Item:10325:0:0"
msgid "flask of Illuminati gobdip"
msgstr "Склянка гоблининой настойки Иллюминатов"

