#. ja: ダークマターG6
#. de: Quantum[p] Grad 6 Dunkelmaterie
#. fr: fragment de matière sombre grade VI
#. column 2: fragments of grade 6 dark matter
#. column 8: It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from superior-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-60.]
#. column 9: Grade 6 Dark Matter
msgctxt "Item:10386:0:0"
msgid "fragment of grade 6 dark matter"
msgstr "осколок тёмной материи 6-го грейда"

#. de: Quanten[p] Grad 6 Dunkelmaterie
#. fr: fragments de matière sombre grade VI
#. column 0: fragment of grade 6 dark matter
#. column 8: It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from superior-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-60.]
#. column 9: Grade 6 Dark Matter
msgctxt "Item:10386:0:2"
msgid "fragments of grade 6 dark matter"
msgstr "осколки тёмной материи 6-го грейда"

#. ja: 他物質への同化特性を持つ精神感応型物質。グレード6<br>[レベル1～60の装備向け汎用修理材料]
#. de: Diese mysteriöse Substanz kann Materie assimilieren und sämtliche Eigenschaften der kopierten Materie über<shy>nehmen, was sie zu einem perfekten Material für Reparaturen von Aus<shy>rüstungs<shy>gegen<shy>ständen der Stufen 1 bis 60 macht.
#. fr: Un minerai réagissant à l'énergie spirituelle, et qui a des facultés d'assimilation avec d'autres matières. Convient aux équipements de niveau 1 à 60.
#. column 0: fragment of grade 6 dark matter
#. column 2: fragments of grade 6 dark matter
#. column 9: Grade 6 Dark Matter
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:10386:0:8"
msgid "It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from superior-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-60.]"
msgstr "Недавно выяснилось, что это вещество неизвестного происхождения способно сливаться с другими веществами и восстанавливать их первоначальное состояние. Тёмная материя этого грейда лучше всего соединяется с искусно созданными предметами из высококачественных материалов.<br><br>[Используется для ремонта снаряжения уровней 1–60.]"

